{"unit_id":"BUGLAN__dsh-voice-alert#card-zh","repo":"BUGLAN/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"7c11054fe38745eca7c137443f12d861d0b2d29f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 是面向 DSH 网页和桌面客户端的会话提醒插件。它在会话显示完成或出现待回复问题、计划审核、授权请求时播放不同提示音，并在设置页提供音量、音色、自定义音频和独立开关。用户也可选择发送系统通知、设置通知正文并测试投递；完成提醒支持防抖，避免短暂停顿误报。适合希望不盯着会话列表也能及时知道任务结束或需要处理的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:20-70","lib/client.js:570-796","lib/client.js:810-889","lib/index.js:22-56"]}
{"unit_id":"BUGLAN__dsh-voice-alert#card-en","repo":"BUGLAN/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"7c11054fe38745eca7c137443f12d861d0b2d29f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-voice-alert plays separate sounds when DSH sessions finish or need a reply. Its Settings page controls volume, tones, custom audio, and optional system notifications. Users can set notification text and test delivery. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:20-70","lib/client.js:570-796","lib/client.js:810-889","lib/index.js:22-56"]}
