{"unit_id":"BUGLAN__dsh-voice-alert#feature-1","repo":"BUGLAN/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"7c11054fe38745eca7c137443f12d861d0b2d29f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的功能「完成提示音」：顶层会话完成时播放所选音色或自定义音频；可设置总音量、单独开关及防抖时长。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:950-1083"]}
{"unit_id":"BUGLAN__dsh-voice-alert#feature-2","repo":"BUGLAN/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"7c11054fe38745eca7c137443f12d861d0b2d29f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的功能「待回复提醒」：会话出现问题、计划审核或授权请求时播放独立提示音，且同一待处理事项只提醒一次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:800-814","lib/client.js:1120-1210"]}
{"unit_id":"BUGLAN__dsh-voice-alert#feature-3","repo":"BUGLAN/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"7c11054fe38745eca7c137443f12d861d0b2d29f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的功能「系统通知」：可为完成和待回复事件分别启用通知、配置正文，并限制为窗口位于后台时发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:376-405","lib/client.js:570-796"]}
{"unit_id":"BUGLAN__dsh-voice-alert#feature-4","repo":"BUGLAN/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"7c11054fe38745eca7c137443f12d861d0b2d29f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的功能「提醒设置页」：在 DSH 设置中试听和选择内置音色、上传不超过 1.5 MB 的自定义音频，并保存偏好。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:570-796","lib/client.js:1348-1389"]}
{"unit_id":"BUGLAN__dsh-voice-alert#caveat-1","repo":"BUGLAN/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"7c11054fe38745eca7c137443f12d861d0b2d29f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的提示音依赖浏览器音频能力，页面需先收到一次用户操作才能解锁音频；自定义音频最大 1.5 MB，并以 data URL 保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:28-30","lib/client.js:178-260","lib/client.js:590-612"]}
{"unit_id":"BUGLAN__dsh-voice-alert#caveat-2","repo":"BUGLAN/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"7c11054fe38745eca7c137443f12d861d0b2d29f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的系统通知默认关闭，需在设置页启用并由操作系统或浏览器授予通知权限；没有可读会话状态服务时相应提醒会降级。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:46-54","lib/client.js:296-330","lib/client.js:828-860"]}
